+### `applyPatch(document, patch)`
+
+Applies a JSON Patch ([RFC 6902](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6902)) — an array of `add`, `remove`, `replace`,
+`move`, `copy` and `test` operations, with JSON Pointer paths — to a JSON document and returns the resulting document as
